 apply lease_wall P.U T P' T' W' ht hp rfl P.height u n (by change packF u p.B _; rw [show p.B=_ from V'.1]; exact p3) v pc (add_nonneg hE.1 V0.1) (add_nonneg hE.2 (add_nonneg V0.2 V0.2))
